    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that would be helpful. but honestly, when people talk about \"intertwined,\" it sometimes feels like a way to avoid saying that immigration can actually dilute or push out the original culture. like, can a nation keep its identity if the core traditions change too much? i'd want the text to be real about that tension instead of just making it sound like everything blends together perfectly.",
